  "description_ko": "AGXGOLF 남성용 오른손 TCI 투어 에디션 웨지 세트 갭 샌드 로브 소프트면 선택\n옵션 이미지\n2X-TALL LENGTH (PLUS 2.0 INCH) | CADET LENGTH (MINUS 1 INCH)\nEXTRA TALL LENGTH (PLUS 1.5 INCH) | REGULAR LENGTH\nTALL LENGTH (PLUS 1 INCH) |\nGOODS SPECIFICS\n- Brand Name : AGXGOLF\n- Manufacturer : AGXGOLF\n- Part Number : wgs-tci-rhGSL_S-XTALL+1.5\n- Sport Type : Golf\n- Hand Orientation : Right\n- Grip Type : Tour-Low Taper\n- Golf Club Flex : Stiff\n- Brand : AGXGOLF\n- Shaft Material : EXTRA TALL LENGTH (PLUS 1.5 INCH)\nFeature\n- We are the Factory! All AGXGOLF Brand Golf Clubs are Crafted in our Howell, MI facility from the Individual Components by our Experienced Club Smiths. Features Strong 306 Tour Grade STAINLESS STEEL construction to provide excellent feel and durability. The 306 SS\n- The \"SOFT FACE\" puts more backspin on the ball for those \"drop and stop\" landings\n- Mens Cadet -1 inch (34.5 inch): for Heights of 52\" to 57\" / Mens Regular (35.5 inch): for Heights of 56\" to 61\" /Mens Tall +1 inch (36.5 inch): for Heights of 60\" to 64\" / Mens Extra Tall +1.5 inch (37.0 inch): for Heights of 63\" to 66\" / Mens 2X-Tall +2 inch (37.5 inch): for Heights of 65\" to 69\n- Leading edge makes chip shots from around the greens easier and more accurate\n- AGXGOLF Magnum Series Stainless Steel shafts: Provide Optimum Accuracy!",
